# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Appendix: Krylov subspace from real time-evolutions {#appendix-krylov-"
"subspace-from-real-time-evolutions}"
msgstr ""
"Appendix: Krylov subspace from real time-evolutions {#appendix-krylov-"
"subspace-from-real-time-evolutions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The unitary Krylov space is defined as\n"
msgstr "Ang unitary Krylov space ay tinukoy bilang\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{K}_U(H, |\\psi\\rangle) = \\text{span}\\left\\{ |\\psi\\rangle,  e^{-iH\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, \\dots, e^{-irH\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle \\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{K}_U(H, |\\psi\\rangle) = \\text{span}\\left\\{ |\\psi\\rangle,  e^{-iH\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, \\dots, e^{-irH\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle \\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for some timestep $dt$ that we will determine later. Temporarily assume $r$ "
"is even: then define $d=r/2$. Notice that when we project the Hamiltonian "
"into the Krylov space above, it is indistinguishable from the Krylov space\n"
msgstr ""
"para sa ilang timestep $dt$ na tutukuyin natin mamaya. Panandaliang "
"ipagpalagay na ang $r$ ay even: kung gayon ay tukuyin ang $d=r/2$. Pansinin "
"na kapag ini-project natin ang Hamiltonian sa Krylov space sa itaas, ito ay "
"hindi mapagkakaila mula sa Krylov space\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{K}_U(H, |\\psi\\rangle) = \\text{span}\\left\\{ e^{i\\,d\\,H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle,  e^{i(d-1)H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, \\dots, e^{-i(d-1)H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, e^{-i\\,d\\,H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle \\right\\},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{K}_U(H, |\\psi\\rangle) = \\text{span}\\left\\{ e^{i\\,d\\,H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle,  e^{i(d-1)H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, \\dots, e^{-i(d-1)H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle, e^{-i\\,d\\,H\\,dt} |\\psi\\rangle \\right\\},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"that is, where all the time-evolutions are shifted backward by $d$ timesteps.\n"
"The reason it is indistinguishable is because the matrix elements\n"
msgstr ""
"ibig sabihin, kung saan ang lahat ng time-evolution ay na-shift pabalik ng $d$ timestep.\n"
"Ang dahilan kung bakit ito ay hindi mapagkakaila ay dahil ang mga matrix element\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\tilde{H}_{j,k} = \\langle\\psi|e^{i\\,j\\,H\\,dt}He^{-i\\,k\\,H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle=\\langle\\psi|He^{i(j-k)H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\tilde{H}_{j,k} = \\langle\\psi|e^{i\\,j\\,H\\,dt}He^{-i\\,k\\,H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle=\\langle\\psi|He^{i(j-k)H\\,dt}|\\psi\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"are invariant under overall shifts of the evolution time, since the time-"
"evolutions commute with the Hamiltonian. For odd $r$, we can use the "
"analysis for $r-1$.\n"
msgstr ""
"ay invariant sa ilalim ng overall shift ng evolution time, dahil ang mga "
"time-evolution ay commute sa Hamiltonian. Para sa odd $r$, maaari nating "
"gamitin ang analysis para sa $r-1$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We want to show that somewhere in this Krylov space, there is guaranteed to "
"be a low-energy state. We do so by way of the following result, which is "
"derived from Theorem 3.1 in [\\[3\\]](#references):\n"
msgstr ""
"Gusto nating ipakita na saanman sa Krylov space na ito, may garantisadong "
"low-energy state. Ginagawa natin ito sa pamamagitan ng sumusunod na resulta,"
" na hinango mula sa Theorem 3.1 sa [\\[3\\]](#references):\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Claim 1:** there exists a function $f$ such that for energies $E$ in the spectral range of the Hamiltonian (that is, between the ground state energy and the maximum energy)...\n"
"1. $f(E_0)=1$\n"
"2. $|f(E)|\\le2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-d}$ for all values of $E$ that lie $\\ge\\delta$ away from $E_0$, that is, it is exponentially suppressed\n"
"3. $f(E)$ is a linear combination of $e^{ijE\\,dt}$ for $j=-d,-d+1,...,d-1,d$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Claim 1:** mayroong function $f$ na para sa mga energy $E$ sa spectral range ng Hamiltonian (ibig sabihin, sa pagitan ng ground state energy at ng maximum energy)...\n"
"1. $f(E_0)=1$\n"
"2. $|f(E)|\\le2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-d}$ para sa lahat ng halaga ng $E$ na nakahiwalay ng $\\ge\\delta$ mula sa $E_0$, ibig sabihin, ito ay exponentially suppressed\n"
"3. Ang $f(E)$ ay isang linear combination ng $e^{ijE\\,dt}$ para sa $j=-d,-d+1,...,d-1,d$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We give a proof below, but that can be safely skipped unless one wants to "
"understand the full, rigorous argument. For now we focus on the implications"
" of the above claim. By property 3 above, we can see that the shifted Krylov"
" space above contains the state $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$. This is our low-energy"
" state. To see why, write $|\\psi\\rangle$ in the energy eigenbasis:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nagbibigay tayo ng patunay sa ibaba, ngunit maaari itong ligtas na laktawan "
"maliban kung nais mong maunawaan ang buong, mahigpit na argumento. Sa ngayon"
" nakatuon tayo sa mga implikasyon ng claim sa itaas. Sa pamamagitan ng "
"property 3 sa itaas, makikita natin na ang shifted Krylov space sa itaas ay "
"naglalaman ng state $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$. Ito ang ating low-energy state. "
"Upang makita kung bakit, isulat ang $|\\psi\\rangle$ sa energy eigenbasis:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\sum_{k=0}^{N}\\gamma_k|E_k\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi\\rangle = \\sum_{k=0}^{N}\\gamma_k|E_k\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $|E_k\\rangle$ is the kth energy eigenstate and $\\gamma_k$ is its "
"amplitude in the initial state $|\\psi\\rangle$. Expressed in terms of this,"
" $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$ is given by\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang $|E_k\\rangle$ ay ang kth energy eigenstate at ang $\\gamma_k$"
" ay ang amplitude nito sa initial state $|\\psi\\rangle$. Ipinahayag sa mga "
"termino nito, ang $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$ ay ibinigay ng\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"f(H)|\\psi\\rangle = \\sum_{k=0}^{N}\\gamma_kf(E_k)|E_k\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"f(H)|\\psi\\rangle = \\sum_{k=0}^{N}\\gamma_kf(E_k)|E_k\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"using the fact that we can replace $H$ by $E_k$ when it acts on the "
"eigenstate $|E_k\\rangle$. The energy error of this state is therefore\n"
msgstr ""
"gamit ang katotohanan na maaari nating palitan ang $H$ ng $E_k$ kapag ito ay"
" kumikilos sa eigenstate $|E_k\\rangle$. Ang energy error ng state na ito ay"
" samakatuwid\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} = \\frac{\\langle\\psi|f(H)(H-E_0)f(H)|\\psi\\rangle}{\\langle\\psi|f(H)^2|\\psi\\rangle}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} = \\frac{\\langle\\psi|f(H)(H-E_0)f(H)|\\psi\\rangle}{\\langle\\psi|f(H)^2|\\psi\\rangle}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"= \\frac{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"= \\frac{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To turn this into an upper bound that is easier to understand, we first "
"separate the sum in the numerator into terms with $E_k-E_0\\le\\delta$ and "
"terms with $E_k-E_0>\\delta$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang gawing upper bound na mas madaling maunawaan, una ay ihiwalay natin "
"ang sum sa numerator sa mga term na may $E_k-E_0\\le\\delta$ at mga term na "
"may $E_k-E_0>\\delta$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} = \\frac{\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} + \\frac{\\sum_{E_k> E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} = \\frac{\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} + \\frac{\\sum_{E_k> E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can upper bound the first term by $\\delta$,\n"
msgstr "Maaari nating i-upper bound ang unang term ng $\\delta$,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} < \\frac{\\delta\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} \\le \\delta,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0)}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} < \\frac{\\delta\\sum_{E_k\\le E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2}{\\sum_{k=0}^{N}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2} \\le \\delta,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the first step follows because $E_k-E_0\\le\\delta$ for every $E_k$ in"
" the sum, and the second step follows because the sum in the numerator is a "
"subset of the sum in the denominator. For the second term, first we lower "
"bound the denominator by $|\\gamma_0|^2$, since $f(E_0)^2=1$: adding "
"everything back together, this gives\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang unang hakbang ay sumusunod dahil $E_k-E_0\\le\\delta$ para sa "
"bawat $E_k$ sa sum, at ang pangalawang hakbang ay sumusunod dahil ang sum sa"
" numerator ay isang subset ng sum sa denominator. Para sa pangalawang term, "
"una ay i-lower bound natin ang denominator ng $|\\gamma_0|^2$, dahil "
"$f(E_0)^2=1$: ang pagdagdag ng lahat pabalik, ito ay nagbibigay ng\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} \\le \\delta + \\frac{1}{|\\gamma_0|^2}\\sum_{E_k>E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} \\le \\delta + \\frac{1}{|\\gamma_0|^2}\\sum_{E_k>E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2f(E_k)^2(E_k-E_0).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To simplify what is left, notice that for all these $E_k$, by the definition"
" of $f$ we know that $f(E_k)^2 \\le 4\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-2d}$. "
"Additionally upper bounding $E_k-E_0<2\\|H\\|$ and upper bounding "
"$\\sum_{E_k>E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2<1$ gives\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang pasimplehin ang natitira, pansinin na para sa lahat ng $E_k$ na ito, "
"sa pamamagitan ng kahulugan ng $f$ alam natin na $f(E_k)^2 \\le 4\\left(1 + "
"\\delta\\right)^{-2d}$. Bukod pa sa pag-upper bound ng $E_k-E_0<2\\|H\\|$ at"
" pag-upper bound ng $\\sum_{E_k>E_0+\\delta}|\\gamma_k|^2<1$ ay nagbibigay "
"ng\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} \\le \\delta + \\frac{8}{|\\gamma_0|^2}\\|H\\|\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-2d}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\text{energy error} \\le \\delta + \\frac{8}{|\\gamma_0|^2}\\|H\\|\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-2d}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This holds for any $\\delta>0$, so if we set $\\delta$ equal to our goal "
"error, then the error bound above converges towards that exponentially with "
"the Krylov dimension $2d=r$. Also note that if $\\delta<E_1-E_0$ then the "
"$\\delta$ term actually goes away entirely in the above bound.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ito ay totoo para sa anumang $\\delta>0$, kaya kung itakda natin ang "
"$\\delta$ na katumbas ng ating layuning error, kung gayon ang error bound sa"
" itaas ay umabot sa exponentially sa Krylov dimension $2d=r$. Pansinin din "
"na kung $\\delta<E_1-E_0$ kung gayon ang $\\delta$ term ay talagang nawawala"
" sa bound sa itaas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To complete the argument, we first note that the above is just the energy "
"error of the particular state $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$, rather than the energy "
"error of the lowest energy state in the Krylov space. However, by the "
"(Rayleigh-Ritz) variational principle, the energy error of the lowest energy"
" state in the Krylov space is upper bounded by the energy error of any state"
" in the Krylov space, so the above is also an upper bound on the energy "
"error of the lowest energy state, that is, the output of the Krylov quantum "
"diagonalization algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"Upang kumpletuhin ang argumento, una ay pansinin natin na ang nasa itaas ay "
"ang energy error lamang ng partikular na state $f(H)|\\psi\\rangle$, sa "
"halip na ang energy error ng pinakamababang energy state sa Krylov space. "
"Gayunpaman, sa pamamagitan ng (Rayleigh-Ritz) variational principle, ang "
"energy error ng pinakamababang energy state sa Krylov space ay upper bounded"
" ng energy error ng anumang state sa Krylov space, kaya ang nasa itaas ay "
"isa ring upper bound sa energy error ng pinakamababang energy state, ibig "
"sabihin, ang output ng Krylov quantum diagonalization algorithm.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A similar analysis as the above can be carried out that additionally "
"accounts for noise and the thresholding procedure discussed in the notebook."
" See [\\[2\\]](#references) and [\\[4\\]](#references) for this analysis.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang katulad na analysis gaya ng sa itaas ay maaaring isagawa na kasama pa "
"ang noise at ang thresholding procedure na tinalakay sa notebook. Tingnan "
"ang [\\[2\\]](#references) at [\\[4\\]](#references) para sa analysis na "
"ito.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Appendix: proof of Claim 1 {#appendix-proof-of-claim-1}"
msgstr "Appendix: proof of Claim 1 {#appendix-proof-of-claim-1}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following is mostly derived from [\\[3\\]](#references), Theorem 3.1: "
"let $ 0 < a < b $ and let $ \\Pi^*_d $ be the space of residual polynomials "
"(polynomials whose value at 0 is 1) of degree at most $ d $. The solution "
"to\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang sumusunod ay karamihan ay hinango mula sa [\\[3\\]](#references), "
"Theorem 3.1: hayaan ang $ 0 < a < b $ at hayaan ang $ \\Pi^*_d $ na maging "
"space ng residual polynomial (polynomial na ang halaga sa 0 ay 1) na may "
"degree na hindi hihigit sa $ d $. Ang solusyon sa\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\beta(a, b, d) = \\min_{p \\in \\Pi^*_d} \\max_{x \\in [a, b]} |p(x)| \\quad\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\beta(a, b, d) = \\min_{p \\in \\Pi^*_d} \\max_{x \\in [a, b]} |p(x)| \\quad\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "is\n"
msgstr "ay\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"p^*(x) = \\frac{T_d\\left(\\frac{b + a - 2x}{b - a}\\right)}{T_d\\left(\\frac{b + a}{b - a}\\right)}, \\quad\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"p^*(x) = \\frac{T_d\\left(\\frac{b + a - 2x}{b - a}\\right)}{T_d\\left(\\frac{b + a}{b - a}\\right)}, \\quad\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and the corresponding minimal value is\n"
msgstr "at ang kaukulang minimal value ay\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\beta(a, b, d) = T_d^{-1}\\left(\\frac{b + a}{b - a}\\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\beta(a, b, d) = T_d^{-1}\\left(\\frac{b + a}{b - a}\\right).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We want to convert this into a function that can be expressed naturally in terms of complex exponentials, because those are the real time-evolutions that generate the quantum Krylov space.\n"
"To do so, it is convenient to introduce the following transformation of energies within the spectral range of the Hamiltonian to numbers in the range $[0,1]$: define\n"
msgstr ""
"Gusto nating i-convert ito sa isang function na maaaring ipahayag nang natural sa mga termino ng complex exponential, dahil iyon ang mga tunay na time-evolution na bumubuo ng quantum Krylov space.\n"
"Upang gawin ito, maginhawa na ipakilala ang sumusunod na transformation ng mga energy sa loob ng spectral range ng Hamiltonian sa mga numero sa range na $[0,1]$: tukuyin\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"g(E) = \\frac{1-\\cos\\big((E-E_0)dt\\big)}{2},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"g(E) = \\frac{1-\\cos\\big((E-E_0)dt\\big)}{2},\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $dt$ is a timestep such that $-\\pi < E_0dt < E_\\text{max}dt < \\pi$.\n"
"Notice that $g(E_0)=0$ and $g(E)$ grows as $E$ moves away from $E_0$.\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang $dt$ ay isang timestep na $-\\pi < E_0dt < E_\\text{max}dt < \\pi$.\n"
"Pansinin na $g(E_0)=0$ at ang $g(E)$ ay lumalaki habang ang $E$ ay lumilipat palayo sa $E_0$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now using the polynomial $p^*(x)$ with the parameters a, b, d set to $a = "
"g(E_0 + \\delta)$, $b = 1$, and d = int(r/2), we define the function:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ngayon gamit ang polynomial $p^*(x)$ na may parameter a, b, d na itinakda sa"
" $a = g(E_0 + \\delta)$, $b = 1$, at d = int(r/2), tinutukoy natin ang "
"function:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"f(E) = p^* \\left( g(E) \\right) = \\frac{T_d\\left(1 + 2\\frac{\\cos\\big((E-E_0)dt\\big) - \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 +\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)}{T_d\\left(1 + 2\\frac{1-\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 + \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"f(E) = p^* \\left( g(E) \\right) = \\frac{T_d\\left(1 + 2\\frac{\\cos\\big((E-E_0)dt\\big) - \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 +\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)}{T_d\\left(1 + 2\\frac{1-\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 + \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $E_0$ is the ground state energy. We can see by inserting "
"$\\cos(x)=\\frac{e^{ix}+e^{-ix}}{2}$ that $f(E)$ is a trigonometric "
"polynomial of degree $d$, that is, a linear combination of $e^{ijE\\,dt}$ "
"for $j=-d,-d+1,...,d-1,d$. Furthermore, from the definition of $p^*(x)$ "
"above we have that $f(E_0)=p(0)=1$ and for any $E$ in the spectral range "
"such that $\\vert E-E_0 \\vert > \\delta$ we have\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang $E_0$ ay ang ground state energy. Makikita natin sa "
"pamamagitan ng pag-insert ng $\\cos(x)=\\frac{e^{ix}+e^{-ix}}{2}$ na ang "
"$f(E)$ ay isang trigonometric polynomial ng degree $d$, ibig sabihin, isang "
"linear combination ng $e^{ijE\\,dt}$ para sa $j=-d,-d+1,...,d-1,d$. Bukod pa"
" rito, mula sa kahulugan ng $p^*(x)$ sa itaas mayroon tayong $f(E_0)=p(0)=1$"
" at para sa anumang $E$ sa spectral range na $\\vert E-E_0 \\vert > \\delta$"
" mayroon tayo\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|f(E)| \\le \\beta(a, b, d) = T_d^{-1}\\left(1 + 2\\frac{1-\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 + \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|f(E)| \\le \\beta(a, b, d) = T_d^{-1}\\left(1 + 2\\frac{1-\\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}{1 + \\cos\\big(\\delta\\,dt\\big)}\\right)\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\leq 2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-d} = 2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-\\lfloor k/2\\rfloor}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\leq 2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-d} = 2\\left(1 + \\delta\\right)^{-\\lfloor k/2\\rfloor}.\n"
"$$\n"

